<title>USA: Employee Solutions says suits have no merit.</title>
<headline>Employee Solutions says suits have no merit.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Employee Solutions Inc said Thursday that several purported class-action lawsuits had been filed against it. The suits are without merit and the company intends to defend itself vigorously, Employee Soluitions said.</p>
<p>It said it had not yet been served with the suits.</p>
<p>The company has been sued for allegedly misrepresenting or omitting material information about its operating results for the 1996 full year and quarters.</p>
